// THE ELEVEN TREATMENT PAGES, added 2026-09-23.
//
// WHY THEY EXIST. BugHerd, 2026-09-22/23: the client opened every row on
// /treatments that had no page of its own and asked, eleven times, "Why doesnt
// this have a dedicated page that is clickable through here". Botox had the
// only one (pages/botox.body.html, hand-written). These eleven are GENERATED by
// build-site.mjs from the records below, through one template
// (treatmentPage() in build-site.mjs), so they cannot drift from each other or
// from treatments-data.mjs — the vitals rail, the menu row and the ticker all
// read the same record there.
//
// THE SHAPE, per slug (every string is plain text unless it says html):
//
//   seoTitle, seoDescription   the <title> and meta description.
//   procedure                  { name, howPerformed } for the MedicalProcedure schema.
//   cover:  { image, top, title (html), lede, facts: [{ num, label }] x3 }
//           `top` true crops to the top of the photograph (u-cover-top).
//   whatItIs:  [p, p]          the first prose block.
//   figure:    image           the photograph between the first two blocks.
//   canDo:     { intro, items: [..] }
//   right:     { text, notIf } "Is it right for me?" and its aside.
//   priceNote                  under the spec rail's buttons. NO PRICES — the
//                              practice quotes at the consultation.
//   who:       { provider: "brooke" | "abby" | "team", heading (html), text }
//   care:      { beforeTitle, before: [..], afterTitle, after: [..], image }
//   faq:       [[question, answer]] — mirrored into the page's FAQPage schema.
//   related:   three slugs from treatments-data.mjs, or "membership".
//   card                       one sentence for this treatment's own card when
//                              another page lists it under "Often paired with".
//
// WHO TREATS. Not Dr. Stone (client feedback 2026-09-15). Brooke, Nurse
// Practitioner Injector, does every injection. Abby, Medical Aesthetician and
// Senior Laser Technician (BugHerd #13, 2026-09-22), does facials and skin
// treatments. "team" where either could.
//
// CLINICAL REVIEW IS OUTSTANDING on every figure and claim here, as on the
// Botox page: standard published ranges for the product, not this practice's
// protocol.

